ořák wrote the symphony in America in 1893; the cor anglais melody of the Largo was later sung as “Goin’ Home”.","difficulty":2,"audio":{"melody":"F4:1.5 Ab4:.5 Ab4:2 | F4:1.5 Eb4:.5 Db4:2 | Eb4:1 F4:1 Ab4:1 F4:1 | Eb4:3","tempo":76,"voice":"strings"}}]}